'''Epic feat'''s are [[feat]]s that are only available to [[epic character]]s, those characters with more than 20 [[character level]]s. They are generally more powerful than other feats, but are otherwise quite similar. From a game mechanics point of view, the only distinguishing feature of epic feats is that having more than 20 character levels is one of the prerequisites.

